<para>The function writes the RefID, bIsUtilFunction and Entt status of the <ref refid="struct_a_g_e_1_1_a_g_e_function" kindref="compound">AGEFunction</ref> to the <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_data_writer" kindref="compound">DataWriter</ref>. If the Entt is present, it also writes the EnttID. It then writes the Val string of the <ref refid="struct_a_g_e_1_1_a_g_e_function" kindref="compound">AGEFunction</ref>.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Serializer</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
